---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About the Ecology">
	<Header />
	
	<main class="flex-grow py-24 px-8">
		<article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-16">
			<section class="space-y-6">
				<h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-charcoal-truth">The Epistemic Truth</h1>
				<p class="text-2xl text-mud-brown italic leading-relaxed">
					"Education is a living ecology, not a linear process."
				</p>
				<div class="prose prose-lg text-mud-brown leading-relaxed space-y-6">
					<p>
						At its core, learning is relational—it does not happen in isolation. This relationship can be best understood as a process of <strong>"impedance matching."</strong>
					</p>
					<p>
						We propose the term <strong>“teaning”</strong> (a fusion of "teaching" and "learning") to name this relational site of education. Anyone involved can only support this relationship to flourish or facilitate this impedance match.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 bg-temple-stone/50 p-12 rounded-3xl border border-mud-brown/10">
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-peacock-blue">Polycentric Systems</h2>
					<p class="text-mud-brown">
						Education is a polycentric, cybernetic system. However, its complexity is often oversimplified. Within institutional contexts, systems often function top-down, with broken cybernetic feedback loops.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-sage-green">POSIWID</h2>
					<p class="text-mud-brown">
						“The purpose of a system is what it does.” We look beyond stated ideologies to understand the actual outcomes and the "dance" of co-regulation that happens in the classroom.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-8">
				<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-charcoal-truth">Our Blue Ocean Strategy</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-mud-brown">
					Within the vast problem space, we are charting a path that goes beyond traditional LMS functions. Gurudevi actively supports individual wellbeing, fosters community, and provides a robust library of knowledge.
				</p>
				
				<div class="bg-void-indigo text-sacred-white p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="relative z-10 space-y-6">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-temple-gold">Isomorphic Reality</h3>
						<p class="opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
							Our core product philosophy is centered on a single underlying structure that presents different views tailored to the needs of the Principal, Teacher, or Student. One reality, multiple lenses.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-sanctuary-saffron/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>
	
	<Footer />
</Layout>
